{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Galactic Pirates","Apulo (a cat-like space alien with the ability to lock a human's emotions) and Latell work for the Division of Space Piracy (or DSP for short). The two of them are extremely destructive in their solving of DSP cases. They are attempting to stop Youmei the space pirate from exploiting Computer Aided Thinking for his own nefarious plans."],"ja":["敵は海賊　～猫たちの饗宴～",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-2679","ids":{"shikimori":2679,"mal":2679,"anilist":2679,"kodik":"serial-21086"},"kodikIds":["serial-21086"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-21086":"2020-01-12T15:33:11Z"},"title":"Галактические пираты","originalTitle":"Teki wa Kaizoku: Neko-tachi no Kyouen","alt":"敵は海賊 ～猫たちの饗宴～ Galactic Pirates 敵は海賊　～猫たちの饗宴～","description":"Апуло (похожий на кошку космический пришелец, обладающий способностью блокировать эмоции человека) и Латель работают в Отделе космического пиратства (сокращенно DSP). Эти двое чрезвычайно деструктивны в своих решениях дел о DSP. Они пытаются помешать космическому пирату Емэю использовать компьютерное мышление в своих собственных гнусных планах.","year":1989,"type":"TV","genres":["Комедия","Фантастика"],"rating":6.31,"popularity":1210,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/2679/947f5cdbc5cc496c1705a1787a3e870a.jpeg","width":555,"height":735},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/1632455779ca93666d041cf29b159fd2c5691f53.jpg","width":704,"height":540}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-21086","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/556930/cac609a6dc9e7de151f72c706881059c/720p","season"